  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Champions Guild Automation:</em> <strong>Brew Elixirs</strong> (after a Long Rest): the module rolls 1d6 for each elixir (two; three at level 5, four at 9, five at 15; a 6 lets you choose) and puts them in your inventory - old elixirs vanish. <strong>Create Elixir:</strong> Magic action, spend a spell slot and choose the effect. Each elixir is a Bonus Action consumable for the drinker or a creature within 5 ft: Healing (2d8 + INT, 3d8 at 9, 4d8 at 15), Swiftness (+10/15/20 ft Speed, 1 hour), Resilience (+1 AC, 10 min/1 hour/8 hours), Boldness (+1d4 to attack rolls and saves, 1 min/10 min/1 hour), Flight (Fly 10/20/30 ft, 10 minutes).</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
